    pause/resume timestamp rebasing, guarded tail-frame finalization) is
    adapted from electron/native/ScreenCaptureKitRecorder.swift.
  - Sources/minami-studio/ZoomExport.swift: the auto-zoom camera model
    (click clustering, region strengths, easing curves, focus-anchored
    transform, safe-zone cursor-follow, chained pan) is a reimplementation
    of the algorithms and constants in src/components/video-editor/ — see
    docs/RECORDLY-ZOOM-PIPELINE.md for the full mapping.

minami-studio is a fork of minami-computer-use
(https://github.com/ZunbaRan/minami-computer-use), an independent clean-room
reproduction of Alma's macOS Computer Use wire surface.
